      {"t":"order","p":"You like Lisbon (to a friend, start with Gostas)","a":["Gostas","de","Lisboa"],"x":["do","da","gosta"],"why":"Gostas is the tu form, and Lisboa takes no article, so de is not a contraction."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Gosto __ Porto.","p":"I like Porto.","a":["do"],"o":["de","da","no"],"why":"Porto takes the masculine article, so the contraction is do."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Prefiro __ café.","p":"I prefer the coffee.","a":["o"],"o":["do","de","a"],"why":"preferir takes no de, and café is masculine, so o."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Não __ do vinho.","p":"I don't like the wine.","a":["gosto"],"o":["gostamos","prefiro","gosto de"],"why":"gosto is the eu form. não sits in front of it."},
      {"t":"type","p":"I like the beach (with the article)","a":["Gosto da praia"],"hint":"gostar de · a praia · with the article","x":["do","de","o"],"why":"praia is feminine, so de plus a is the contraction da."},
      {"t":"type","p":"You like Lisbon (to a friend)","a":["Gostas de Lisboa","Tu gostas de Lisboa"],"hint":"gostar · Lisboa · to a friend","x":["gosta","gosto","do"],"why":"Gostas is the tu form, and Lisboa takes no article, so there is no contraction."},
      {"t":"type","p":"We like the cheese because it is good (with the article)","a":["Gostamos do queijo porque é bom","Nós gostamos do queijo porque é bom"],"hint":"gostar · o queijo · porque · with the article","x":["da","de","gosto"],"why":"queijo is masculine, so the contraction is do, and gostamos is the nós form."}
